    <description>Ragavan gives concurrent Git worktrees isolated development environments without changing the commands developers already use.

This early preview supports PowerShell, Bun, and simple Vite development scripts. In an enabled repository, commands such as `bun dev` receive a stable worktree-specific port automatically.</description>
    <summary>Zero-config development isolation for concurrent Git worktrees.</summary>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/chiefGui/ragavan/releases</releaseNotes>
